1
00:00:00,233 --> 00:00:01,630
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,440
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,940
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,213 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:07,013 --> 00:00:08,366
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,713 --> 00:00:10,060
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,373 --> 00:00:13,380
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,253
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,493 --> 00:00:16,960
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,580
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,726 --> 00:00:20,313
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,553 --> 00:00:21,946
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,886 --> 00:00:27,300
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,740
=The One=

16
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,300
=Episode 11=

17
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:32,560
Ms. Su.

18
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,030
I can't believe it's you.

19
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:37,110
Ma'am, you know me?

20
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:38,920
Of course. Don't you remember?

21
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:40,110
Five years ago,

22
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:41,880
you were my legal aid attorney.

23
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,280
You handled my divorce case for free.

24
00:00:47,026 --> 00:00:48,240
You have the nerve to ask for a divorce?

25
00:00:48,713 --> 00:00:50,466
(Five years ago)
I am divorcing you!

26
00:00:50,813 --> 00:00:51,573
- Still talking back?
- You monster!

27
00:00:51,933 --> 00:00:52,753
I'll beat you to death!

28
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:53,400
Stop!

29
00:00:55,346 --> 00:00:56,600
I'm Ms. Lin's attorney.

30
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,573
My client has filed for divorce.

31
00:00:59,060 --> 00:00:59,740
What you're doing now

32
00:01:00,013 --> 00:01:01,606
constitutes assault.

33
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,200
You're the kid

34
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:11,040
who stabbed his stepfather.

35
00:01:12,950 --> 00:01:13,590
Mm.

36
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:17,040
You recognized me all along.

37
00:01:19,710 --> 00:01:20,590
Why didn't you say anything?

38
00:01:24,086 --> 00:01:26,560
♪You turn back when the lights go out♪

39
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,000
If I had told you,

40
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,200
would you still have slept with me?

41
00:01:34,586 --> 00:01:36,286
♪But he's already gone♪

42
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:38,400
Answer me.

43
00:01:38,740 --> 00:01:41,766
♪He's vanished into the crowd♪

44
00:01:42,186 --> 00:01:46,126
♪Now all you're left with is regret♪

45
00:01:47,753 --> 00:01:49,506
♪You always back away♪

46
00:01:50,686 --> 00:01:53,173
♪Why didn't you ask him to stay?♪

47
00:01:53,893 --> 00:01:56,553
♪Why didn't you give him an answer?♪

48
00:01:56,573 --> 00:01:57,350
No.

49
00:02:00,230 --> 00:02:01,070
Why?

50
00:02:01,070 --> 00:02:02,840
Because you were underage when we met.

51
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:04,753
I'm Cheng Lin.

52
00:02:05,046 --> 00:02:05,920
Will you remember me?

53
00:02:08,026 --> 00:02:08,246
Mm.

54
00:02:08,866 --> 00:02:11,660
♪Did you take it all for granted?♪

55
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:15,960
This is such a mess.

56
00:02:16,870 --> 00:02:17,910
It's my own fault.

57
00:02:19,190 --> 00:02:20,750
I should've recognized you both.

58
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,840
How did I not?

59
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:25,680
Su Yan.

60
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:26,560
Let me take you home.

61
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:30,160
♪You always back away♪

62
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:33,240
No need.

63
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,190
Just take care of your mom.

64
00:02:44,870 --> 00:02:45,800
I can tell.

65
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,910
Cheng Lin likes you.

66
00:02:48,310 --> 00:02:49,630
Ever since you showed up,

67
00:02:49,710 --> 00:02:50,800
(30 minutes ago)
the way he looks at you...

68
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,910
he can't hide it.

69
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:53,520
Do you...

70
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,520
like Cheng Lin too?

71
00:02:59,400 --> 00:02:59,960
I...

72
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:07,190
I...

73
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,630
I'm not against it.

74
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,190
I'm just worried.

75
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:13,470
Look,

76
00:03:14,030 --> 00:03:16,680
you're successful and charming.

77
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:18,870
Cheng Lin...

78
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,710
he's only 19.

79
00:03:23,310 --> 00:03:24,750
And he's impulsive.

80
00:03:26,750 --> 00:03:27,520
I'm afraid

81
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:29,150
he's not good enough for you.

82
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,680
(If...)

83
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,870
(if you do love him too,)

84
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,150
(please)

85
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,400
(let him go.)

86
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:38,870
(Please.)

87
00:03:56,426 --> 00:03:56,806
(Su Yan.)

88
00:03:58,466 --> 00:03:58,886
(Tell me.)

89
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,506
(What would make you feel better?)

90
00:04:01,810 --> 00:04:05,210
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

91
00:04:05,210 --> 00:04:08,793
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

92
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:12,413
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

93
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:16,620
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

94
00:04:31,350 --> 00:04:34,566
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

95
00:04:34,973 --> 00:04:38,130
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

96
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:41,480
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

97
00:04:41,620 --> 00:04:45,140
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

98
00:04:45,193 --> 00:04:48,766
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

99
00:04:48,933 --> 00:04:52,406
♪I hum this song alone♪

100
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:56,033
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

101
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:59,900
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

102
00:05:00,010 --> 00:05:03,290
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

103
00:05:03,380 --> 00:05:07,020
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

104
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:10,553
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

105
00:05:10,566 --> 00:05:15,146
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
